# A long conversation opens at its latest turns, scrolls, and loads earlier turns on request.
# Elements stay in the accessibility tree while scrolled out of view, so the
# screenshots are the evidence of where the reader is.
# iOS: testSimulatorOpensLongInterruptedHistoryAtLatestMessage, testSimulatorLoadsEarlierHistoryOnTapAtTheReadingPosition
fixture /long-conversation/long-history
expect "検証プロジェクト" 30000
press 検証プロジェクト
press "Long conversation" 20000
expect "Review section 14, input 0." 20000
expect_absent "Review section 2, input 0."
screenshot latest
scroll "Review section 14, input 0." -20
screenshot scrolled
press 以前のターンを読み込む
expect "Review section 2, input 0." 20000
screenshot earlier
